#format http://ns.nuke24.net/TEF/Formats/SyntaxV0.3
# TOGETL project vocabulary.

=namespace http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/
short-description: Terms minted for the TOGETL ETL project.

=type http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/Document
short-description: A source document that was read by an importer.

=type http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/ParseIssue
short-description: A problem encountered while reading a source document.

=type http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/File
short-description: A file referenced by a source document.

=type http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/Part
short-description: A 3D-printable part.

=type http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/PartCategory
short-description: A category of parts.

=type http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/PartSet
short-description: A named set of parts.

=type http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/Category
short-description: A general category record.

=type http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/Standard
short-description: A standard or specification record.

=type http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/Narration
short-description: A narrative note attached to project data.

=type http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/Format
short-description: A data format.

=type http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/Namespace
short-description: An RDF namespace or ontology.

=type http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/ProjectBase
short-description: A project base record.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/sourceUrl
short-description: The canonical URL of a source document.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/sha256
short-description: SHA-256 of the source document bytes.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/byteLength
short-description: Length of the source document in bytes.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/format
short-description: The detected or declared source format.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/parserVersion
short-description: Version of the parser that read the document.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/hasBom
short-description: Whether the source began with a UTF-8 byte order mark.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/document
short-description: Links a derived resource to its source document.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/parseIssue
short-description: Links a document to one of its parse issues.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/severity
short-description: Severity of a parse issue.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/code
short-description: Machine-readable code for a parse issue.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/message
short-description: Human-readable parse issue message.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/raw
short-description: Raw source text associated with a parse issue.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/unmappedEntry
short-description: An entry type that the selected dialect did not map.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/unmappedField
short-description: A header that the selected dialect did not map.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/asWritten
short-description: The original spelling or value before normalization.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/filename
short-description: The file name recorded alongside a file reference.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/name
short-description: A short name.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/title
short-description: A human-readable title.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/shortDescription
short-description: A one-line description.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/tag
short-description: A tag or label.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/keyword
short-description: A keyword.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/memberOf
short-description: A set or category that a resource belongs to.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/member
short-description: A member of a set.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/seeAlso
short-description: A related resource.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/obsoletedBy
short-description: A resource that replaces this one.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/stlFile
short-description: An STL model file.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/csgFile
short-description: A CSG model file.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/file
short-description: A file associated with a resource.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/imageRef
short-description: An image reference.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/photoRef
short-description: A photograph reference.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/docRef
short-description: A documentation reference.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/demoRef
short-description: A demonstration reference.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/openscadRenderingRef
short-description: A rendering produced from an OpenSCAD model.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/openscadRendering
short-description: An OpenSCAD rendering reference.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/openscadDesignRef
short-description: An OpenSCAD design source reference.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/mirror
short-description: A mirror of a resource.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/alias
short-description: An alternative identifier or location.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/created
short-description: A creation date or date description.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/source
short-description: A source reference for a resource.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/projectHomepageUrl
short-description: The home page of a project.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/subformatOf
short-description: A format that this format is a subformat of.

=attribute http://ns.nuke24.net/TOGETL/contentType
short-description: A content type declaration.
